# Design handoffs, prototypes and scratch reference material. Kept locally
# for provenance, never pushed.
reference/

# Claude Code. The directory is deliberately partly tracked: agent definitions
# and team-wide settings are shared, machine-local state is not. Until now the
# local files were only kept out by one developer's global gitignore, which
# doesn't travel with a clone; these rules do.
#
# Shared (do NOT add ignores for these): .claude/agents/, .claude/settings.json,
# .claude/agent-memory/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/agent-memory-local/
.claude/worktrees/
# Runtime state the tooling writes as it goes. Noise in a diff at best, and a
# source of spurious conflicts between machines at worst.
.claude/checkpoints/
.claude/mailbox/
.claude/routines/.state/
.claude/agent-registry.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/assistant-daemon-state.json
.claude/first-run
